{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13010","headline":"送李宾客荆南迎亲 · 独孤及","name":"送李宾客荆南迎亲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宗室刘中垒，文场谢客儿。\n当爲天北斗，曾使海西陲。\n毛节精诚着，铜楼羽翼施。\n还申供帐别，言赴倚门期。\n恩渥沾行李，晨昏在路岐。\n君亲两报遂，不敢议伤离。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13010.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13010","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}